By default, Spring Batch executes all jobs 
it can find (i.e., that are configured as in CustomerReportJobConfig) at startup. 
To change this behavior, disable job execution at startup by adding 
the following property to application.properties:

spring.batch.job.enabled=false

Spring Batch Meta Data is AutoConfigured.
Need not to write the Batch configuraion.xml

URL to Execute the Task
http://localhost:8080/launchjob
 
 
 